  ("G", "My favourite part: TCF7L2, KCNQ1 and FTO risk alleles, at frequencies reported for South Asian populations. TCF7L2 in particular affects how much insulin the pancreas releases. And every patient is exported as an HL7 FHIR bundle, so the pipeline is interoperable and ready for the Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission.", 0),
