  ("M", "GlucoTwin flags seventy seven percent of spike episodes before they begin, with a median warning of eighty five minutes.", 0),
  ("G", "That's enough time to change a portion, take a walk, or check medication! And it does that with only zero point seven nine false alerts per patient per day. Less than one a day.", 0),
